if we wanted some. Of course we said yes especially after they said they didn't handle the ones they offered us. Sooooo good. Hubby got the burger again and although we forgot to ask for cheese and he still loved it. So happy with this place. Only wish it was a bigger space."},{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","review_id":"B63ZhzYoNE88VjDdWYDQQg","date":"2018-10-19T02:09:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.940849781036377,"text_excerpt":"tl;dr Out of this world bar food. By far the best meal we ate during our five day stint in NOLA. Came in with a group of four and after some long deliberations over the menu (sooo many dang good sounding options to choose from) we decided on the Piggyback Fries, Bistro Burger, Southern Chicken Sandwich, Brussel Sprouts w/ Bacon, and Bistro Wedge Salad. Our food came out quick and we couldn't believe how huge the Piggyback Fries were. Served on what looked like a 16\" pizza pan, we were unsure if we'd eat them all but after first bite we couldn't stop. Perfectly fried and loaded with cheese sauce, BBQ sauce, pulled pork, bacon, ranch, and scallions. Some of the best fries we've ever had. I ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","photo_id":"bslOtEqJfF8jnYWIIifWnQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bslOtEqJfF8jnYWIIifWnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8944230675697327},{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","photo_id":"DmGZrFMovcqONWnN2okH5A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DmGZrFMovcqONWnN2okH5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8092278242111206},{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","photo_id":"85jLUhR-ZngJRbZOD_27zA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/85jLUhR-ZngJRbZOD_27zA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7898555994033813},{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","photo_id":"wGYHsV_D77z9_vKF8XNC9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wGYHsV_D77z9_vKF8XNC9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.785072922706604},{"business_id":"Xh08NmHdB86LexgXrIxr2Q","photo_id":"aBY0z0Czc3LR8-QnhSor6Q","l